post.summary:
Makes a company the installation's primary company (the one whose administrators manage the
identity providers). Only an active administrator of the current primary company may do this;
the flag moves in one transaction, so there is always exactly one primary company.

Creates or updates customers from a CSV, XLSX or ODS file (detected from the content), keyed by
`code`. All-or-nothing: with any row error nothing is written (422 with every error);
`dry_run=true` only reports. `sheet` picks the sheet of a spreadsheet.

get.summary:
Checks a VAT number for the customer form: the format and check digits, other customers with
the same number, and with `lookup=true` the name and address VIES has for it. Advice only;
nothing is stored. The lookup needs `customers.write`: it makes the server call VIES.

post.summary:
Creates or updates products from a CSV, XLSX or ODS file (detected from the content), keyed by
`code`. All-or-nothing: with any row error nothing is written (422 with every error);
`dry_run=true` only reports. `sheet` picks the sheet of a spreadsheet.

power_grid_id.description:
The power grid at the delivery country (the new one when it changes, else the stored one);
it must belong to it (422). Unchanged when omitted, except that a grid the new delivery
country does not have is cleared.
